{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35229","headline":"闻人说海北事有感 · 聂夷中","name":"闻人说海北事有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故乡归路隔高雷，见说年来事可哀。\n村落日中眠虎豹，田园雨後长蒿莱。\n海隅久已无春色，地底真成有劫灰。\n荆棘满山行不得，不知当日是谁栽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}